  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several different entities that go by the name **\"Chase Capital Services\"** or similar names. Here's an overview of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfe6 JPMorgan Chase \u2013 Capital & Financial Services\nChase (part of JPMorgan Chase) offers a broad range of financial services including credit cards, mortgages, commercial banking, auto loans, investing, and retirement planning.\n\nOn the commercial/capital side:\n- They provide tailored credit, financing, treasury, and payment solutions for businesses of all sizes and commercial real estate, backed by the strength and stability of J.P. Morgan, with dedicated experts delivering industry-specific guidance.\n- They help clients achieve long-term strategic goals through financing, liquidity, payments, risk management, and investment banking solutions, including M&A, capital raising, and risk management for corporations, institutions, and governments.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83c\udfe0 Chase Capital Holdings, LLC (Atlanta, GA)\nChase Capital Holdings, LLC is a trusted partner in investment real estate financing \u2014 a family-owned and operated boutique lending business based in Atlanta with 20+ years of expertise. Their mission is to cater to the needs of experienced real estate investors throughout the Southeastern United States, offering quick and straightforward funding solutions for residential real estate investments.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83c\udf3f Chase Capital (Canada)\nChase Capital is a private capital platform dedicated to investing in, advising, and helping unique businesses grow into dynamic platforms across Canada and other regions globally. They bring valuable capital and trusted industry expertise to acquisitions and partnerships with existing owners and operators, and pride themselves on executing nimble and creative transactions.\n\nThey drive success in key growth sectors such as energy transition, waste & resource recovery infrastructure, and food & agricultural production, focusing on investments in the energy sector and supporting sustainable and innovative projects, as well as developing essential infrastructure services.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udcc8 Chase Capital Partners (Closed)\nChase Capital Partners had a broad platform that positioned them to deliver extensive product capabilities \u2014 including lending, treasury services, investment banking, and asset management \u2014 to meet U.S. and international financial needs. However, Chase Capital Partners is permanently closed.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Chase Capital Services** you're referring to? For example:\n- Are you looking for **JPMorgan Chase's** capital/financial services?\n- The **Atlanta-based real estate lender** (Chase Capital Holdings)?\n- The **Canadian private equity firm** (Chase Capital)?\n\nI'm happy to provide more specific information!",
